{"v":1,"book":"Mal","ch":3,"verses":[{"n":1,"text":"I am about to send My messenger, and he will clear the way before Me; and suddenly the Lord, whom you seek, will come to His temple. And the Angel of the covenant, whom you desire, He will come, says Jehovah of hosts.","tok":[{"t":"I am about to "},{"t":"send","s":["H7971"],"a":[1]},{"t":" My "},{"t":"messenger","s":["H4397"],"a":[2]},{"t":", and he will clear the "},{"t":"way","s":["H1870"],"a":[4]},{"t":" "},{"t":"before","s":["H6440"],"a":[5]},{"t":" Me; and "},{"t":"suddenly","s":["H6597"],"a":[6]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"Lord","s":["H0113"],"a":[10]},{"t":", whom you "},{"t":"seek","s":["H1245"],"a":[13]},{"t":", "},{"t":"will","s":["H6597"],"a":[6]},{"t":" "},{"t":"come","s":["H0935"],"a":[7]},{"t":" to His "},{"t":"temple","s":["H1964"],"a":[9]},{"t":". And the "},{"t":"Angel","s":["H4397"],"a":[14]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"covenant","s":["H1285"],"a":[15]},{"t":", whom you desire, He will "},{"t":"come","s":["H0935"],"a":[20]},{"t":", "},{"t":"says","s":["H0559"],"a":[21]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[22]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"hosts","s":["H6635"],"a":[23]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":2,"text":"And who will endure the day of His coming? And who will stand when He appears? For He is like a refiner’s fire and like fullers’ soap.","tok":[{"t":"And who will endure the "},{"t":"day","s":["H3117"],"a":[3]},{"t":" of His "},{"t":"coming","s":["H0935"],"a":[4]},{"t":"? And who will "},{"t":"stand","s":["H5975"],"a":[6]},{"t":" when He "},{"t":"appears","s":["H7200"],"a":[7]},{"t":"? For He is like a "},{"t":"refiner’s","s":["H6884"],"a":[11]},{"t":" "},{"t":"fire","s":["H0784"],"a":[10]},{"t":" and like "},{"t":"fullers","s":["H3526"],"a":[13]},{"t":"’ "},{"t":"soap","s":["H1287"],"a":[12]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":3,"text":"And He will sit as a refiner and a purifier of silver, and He will purify the sons of Levi and purge them like gold and like silver, and they will offer to Jehovah a sacrifice in righteousness.","tok":[{"t":"And He will "},{"t":"sit","s":["H3427"],"a":[0]},{"t":" as a "},{"t":"refiner","s":["H6884"],"a":[1]},{"t":" and a "},{"t":"purifier","s":["H2891"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"silver","s":["H3701"],"a":[3]},{"t":", and He will "},{"t":"purify","s":["H2891"],"a":[4]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"sons","s":["H1121"],"a":[6]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Levi","s":["H3878"],"a":[7]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"purge","s":["H2212"],"a":[8]},{"t":" them like "},{"t":"gold","s":["H2091"],"a":[10]},{"t":" and like "},{"t":"silver","s":["H3701"],"a":[11]},{"t":", and they will "},{"t":"offer","s":["H5066"],"a":[14]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[13]},{"t":" a "},{"t":"sacrifice","s":["H4503"],"a":[15]},{"t":" in "},{"t":"righteousness","s":["H6666"],"a":[16]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":4,"text":"And the sacrifice of Judah and of Jerusalem will be pleasing to Jehovah, as in the days of old and as in the former years.","tok":[{"t":"And the "},{"t":"sacrifice","s":["H4503"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Judah","s":["H3063"],"a":[3]},{"t":" and of "},{"t":"Jerusalem","s":["H3389"],"a":[4]},{"t":" will be pleasing to "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[1]},{"t":", as in the "},{"t":"days","s":["H3117"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"old","s":["H5769"],"a":[6]},{"t":" and as in the "},{"t":"former","s":["H6931"],"a":[8]},{"t":" "},{"t":"years","s":["H8141"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":5,"text":"And I will draw near to you for judgment; and I will be a swift witness against the sorcerers and against the adulterers and against those who swear falsely and against those who oppress the hired worker for his hire and the widow and the orphan, and those who turn the stranger aside, and who do not fear Me, says Jehovah of hosts.","tok":[{"t":"And I will draw "},{"t":"near","s":["H7126"],"a":[0]},{"t":" to you for "},{"t":"judgment","s":["H4941"],"a":[2]},{"t":"; and I will be a "},{"t":"swift","s":["H4116"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"witness","s":["H5707"],"a":[4]},{"t":" against the "},{"t":"sorcerers","s":["H3784"],"a":[6]},{"t":" and against the "},{"t":"adulterers","s":["H5003"],"a":[7]},{"t":" and against those who swear "},{"t":"falsely","s":["H8267"],"a":[9]},{"t":" and against those who "},{"t":"oppress","s":["H6231"],"a":[10]},{"t":" the hired worker for his hire and the "},{"t":"widow","s":["H0490"],"a":[13]},{"t":" and the orphan, and those who turn the "},{"t":"stranger","s":["H1616"],"a":[16]},{"t":" "},{"t":"aside","s":["H5186"],"a":[15]},{"t":", and who "},{"t":"do","s":["H1616"],"a":[16]},{"t":" not "},{"t":"fear","s":["H3372"],"a":[18]},{"t":" Me, "},{"t":"says","s":["H0559"],"a":[19]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[20]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"hosts","s":["H6635"],"a":[21]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":6,"text":"For I, Jehovah, do not change; therefore you, O sons of Jacob, are not consumed.","tok":[{"t":"For I, "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[2]},{"t":", do not "},{"t":"change","s":["H8138"],"a":[4]},{"t":"; therefore you, O "},{"t":"sons","s":["H1121"],"a":[6]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Jacob","s":["H3290"],"a":[7]},{"t":", are not "},{"t":"consumed","s":["H3615"],"a":[9]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":7,"text":"From the days of your fathers you have turned aside from My statutes and have not kept them. Return to Me, and I will return to you, says Jehovah of hosts. But you say, How shall we return?","tok":[{"t":"From the "},{"t":"days","s":["H3117"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of your "},{"t":"fathers","s":["H0001"],"a":[1]},{"t":" you have turned aside from My statutes and have not "},{"t":"kept","s":["H8104"],"a":[5]},{"t":" them. "},{"t":"Return","s":["H7725"],"a":[6]},{"t":" to Me, and I will "},{"t":"return","s":["H7725"],"a":[8]},{"t":" to you, says "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[11]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"hosts","s":["H6635"],"a":[12]},{"t":". But you "},{"t":"say","s":["H0559"],"a":[10]},{"t":", How shall we "},{"t":"return","s":["H7725"],"a":[15]},{"t":"?"}]},{"n":8,"text":"Will a man rob God? Yet you have robbed Me. But you say, How have we robbed You? In tithes and offerings.","tok":[{"t":"Will a "},{"t":"man","s":["H0120"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"rob","s":["H6906"],"a":[0]},{"t":" "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[2]},{"t":"? Yet you have "},{"t":"robbed","s":["H6906"],"a":[5]},{"t":" Me. But you "},{"t":"say","s":["H0559"],"a":[7]},{"t":", How have we "},{"t":"robbed","s":["H6906"],"a":[9]},{"t":" You? In "},{"t":"tithes","s":["H4643"],"a":[10]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"offerings","s":["H8641"],"a":[11]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":9,"text":"With the curse you are cursed, yet you, even the whole nation, rob Me.","tok":[{"t":"With the "},{"t":"curse","s":["H3994"],"a":[0]},{"t":" you are "},{"t":"cursed","s":["H0779"],"a":[2]},{"t":", yet you, even the whole "},{"t":"nation","s":["H1471"],"a":[6]},{"t":", rob Me."}]},{"n":10,"text":"Bring the whole tithe to the storehouse that there may be food in My house; and prove Me, if you will, by this, says Jehovah of hosts, whether I will open to you the windows of heaven and pour out blessing for you until there is no room for it.","tok":[{"t":"Bring","s":["H0935"],"a":[0]},{"t":" the whole "},{"t":"tithe","s":["H4643"],"a":[3]},{"t":" to the "},{"t":"storehouse","s":["H0214"],"a":[6]},{"t":" that there may be food in My "},{"t":"house","s":["H1004"],"a":[5]},{"t":"; and "},{"t":"prove","s":["H0974"],"a":[10]},{"t":" Me, if you will, by this, "},{"t":"says","s":["H0559"],"a":[13]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[14]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"hosts","s":["H6635"],"a":[15]},{"t":", whether I will "},{"t":"open","s":["H6605"],"a":[18]},{"t":" to you the "},{"t":"windows","s":["H0699"],"a":[21]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"heaven","s":["H8064"],"a":[22]},{"t":" and pour "},{"t":"out","s":["H7324"],"a":[23]},{"t":" "},{"t":"blessing","s":["H1293"],"a":[25]},{"t":" for you until there is no room for it."}]},{"n":11,"text":"And I will rebuke the devourer for your sake, and for your sake he will not destroy the fruit of the ground; and for your sake the vine will not lose its fruit in the field, says Jehovah of hosts.","tok":[{"t":"And I will "},{"t":"rebuke","s":["H1605"],"a":[0]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"devourer","s":["H0398"],"a":[2]},{"t":" for your sake, and for your sake he will not "},{"t":"destroy","s":["H7843"],"a":[4]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"fruit","s":["H6529"],"a":[7]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"ground","s":["H0127"],"a":[8]},{"t":"; and for your sake the "},{"t":"vine","s":["H1612"],"a":[12]},{"t":" will not lose its "},{"t":"fruit","s":["H7921"],"a":[10]},{"t":" in the "},{"t":"field","s":["H7704"],"a":[13]},{"t":", "},{"t":"says","s":["H0559"],"a":[14]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[15]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"hosts","s":["H6635"],"a":[16]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":12,"text":"And all the nations will call you blessed, for you will be a land of delight, says Jehovah of hosts.","tok":[{"t":"And all the "},{"t":"nations","s":["H1471"],"a":[3]},{"t":" will call you "},{"t":"blessed","s":["H0833"],"a":[0]},{"t":", for you will be a "},{"t":"land","s":["H0776"],"a":[7]},{"t":" of delight, "},{"t":"says","s":["H0559"],"a":[9]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[10]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"hosts","s":["H6635"],"a":[11]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":13,"text":"Your words have been strongly against Me, says Jehovah; but you say, What have we spoken against You?","tok":[{"t":"Your "},{"t":"words","s":["H1697"],"a":[2]},{"t":" have been strongly against Me, "},{"t":"says","s":["H0559"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[4]},{"t":"; but you "},{"t":"say","s":["H0559"],"a":[5]},{"t":", What have we "},{"t":"spoken","s":["H1696"],"a":[7]},{"t":" against You?"}]},{"n":14,"text":"You say, It is vain to serve God; and what profit is it that we have kept His charge and have walked mournfully before Jehovah of hosts?","tok":[{"t":"You say, It is "},{"t":"vain","s":["H7723"],"a":[1]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"serve","s":["H5647"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[3]},{"t":"; and what "},{"t":"profit","s":["H1215"],"a":[5]},{"t":" is it that we have "},{"t":"kept","s":["H8104"],"a":[7]},{"t":" His charge and have "},{"t":"walked","s":["H1980"],"a":[10]},{"t":" "},{"t":"mournfully","s":["H6941"],"a":[11]},{"t":" "},{"t":"before","s":["H6440"],"a":[12]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[13]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"hosts","s":["H6635"],"a":[14]},{"t":"?"}]},{"n":15,"text":"And now we call the arrogant blessed; not only have those who act wickedly been built up, but they also try God and escape.","tok":[{"t":"And now we "},{"t":"call","s":["H0833"],"a":[2]},{"t":" the arrogant blessed; not only have those who act wickedly been built "},{"t":"up","s":["H1129"],"a":[5]},{"t":", but they also try "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[10]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"escape","s":["H4422"],"a":[11]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":16,"text":"Then those who feared Jehovah spoke to one another, each with his neighbor. And Jehovah gave heed and listened, and a book of remembrance was written before Him of those who feared Jehovah and considered His name.","tok":[{"t":"Then those who "},{"t":"feared","s":["H3373"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"spoke","s":["H1696"],"a":[1]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"one","s":["H0376"],"a":[4]},{"t":" "},{"t":"another","s":["H7453"],"a":[6]},{"t":", each with his neighbor. And "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[8]},{"t":" gave heed and listened, and a "},{"t":"book","s":["H5612"],"a":[11]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"remembrance","s":["H2146"],"a":[12]},{"t":" was "},{"t":"written","s":["H3789"],"a":[10]},{"t":" "},{"t":"before","s":["H6440"],"a":[13]},{"t":" Him of those who "},{"t":"feared","s":["H3373"],"a":[14]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[15]},{"t":" and considered His "},{"t":"name","s":["H8034"],"a":[17]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":17,"text":"And they will be Mine, says Jehovah of hosts, a personal treasure, in the day that I prepare; and I will spare them, as a man spares his son who serves him.","tok":[{"t":"And they will be Mine, "},{"t":"says","s":["H0559"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[3]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"hosts","s":["H6635"],"a":[4]},{"t":", a personal treasure, in the "},{"t":"day","s":["H3117"],"a":[5]},{"t":" that I prepare; and I will "},{"t":"spare","s":["H2550"],"a":[10]},{"t":" them, as a "},{"t":"man","s":["H0376"],"a":[14]},{"t":" "},{"t":"spares","s":["H2550"],"a":[13]},{"t":" his "},{"t":"son","s":["H1121"],"a":[16]},{"t":" who "},{"t":"serves","s":["H5647"],"a":[17]},{"t":" him."}]},{"n":18,"text":"And you will return and discern between him who is righteous and him who is wicked, between him who serves God and him who does not serve Him.","tok":[{"t":"And you will "},{"t":"return","s":["H7725"],"a":[0]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"discern","s":["H7200"],"a":[1]},{"t":" between him who is "},{"t":"righteous","s":["H6662"],"a":[3]},{"t":" and him who is "},{"t":"wicked","s":["H7563"],"a":[4]},{"t":", between him who "},{"t":"serves","s":["H5647"],"a":[6]},{"t":" "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[7]},{"t":" and him who does not "},{"t":"serve","s":["H5647"],"a":[10]},{"t":" Him."}]}]}
